Scope. This licence covers the QSM-CI harness: the `qsm-ci` CLI (qsm_ci/), the
scorer (eval/), the pipeline and tooling (scripts/), the workflow definitions
(.github/) and the leaderboard site (web/).

It does NOT cover the method submissions under algorithms/. Each submission
wraps a third-party reconstruction method and carries its own terms, declared in
that folder's algorithm.yml `license:` field (and, where present, its own LICENSE
file). Many are MIT; a number are academic-use only or included with the
authors' permission and are not redistributed in this repository.
